This image shows a large illuminated elephant sculpture displayed at what appears to be an indoor exhibition or festival. The elephant is decorated with intricate blue and white patterns featuring mandalas, flowers, and geometric designs that are lit from within, creating a striking glowing effect. The decorative motifs include circular patterns, scalloped edges, dots, and floral elements.

In the foreground, there's a row of glowing green spherical lights mounted on posts, creating a border or pathway. There's also an information plaque or sign visible on the left side with the number "2" on it.

The setting appears to be a large indoor venue with industrial-style ceiling and lighting visible in the background. Silhouettes of visitors can be seen around and behind the elephant sculpture, giving scale to this impressive art installation. The overall atmosphere is dark with dramatic lighting that makes the illuminated elephant the focal point of the scene.
